flowchart TD
  REQ[Requete HTTP] --> AUTH{Token Sanctum ?}
  AUTH -->|Non| E401[401]
  AUTH -->|Oui| ROLE{Middleware role}
  ROLE -->|Refuse| E403[403]
  ROLE -->|OK| CTRL[Controleur]
  CTRL --> SM{Transition parcours ?}
  SM -->|Illegale| E422[422 metier]
  SM -->|OK / N/A| OWN{Perimetre patient / medecin}
  OWN -->|Non| E403
  OWN -->|Oui| OK[200 / 201]
